  "intuition": "This loss promotes preferences where the advantage signals (e.g., advantage_w or advantage_l) are aligned with the cost differences (cost_gap). By weighting the advantage signals with the sign of the cost gap, it encourages the model to rank higher those options with better advantage scores when costs are low, aligning the preference with cost-efficient improvements.",
